task: frame-said-is-content
agent: opus5-intent
started: 2026-09-04
branch: feature/frame-said-is-content
worktree: ../okay-wt-said

why: The consumer reviewed conversation-over-frame by migrating to it
  and found one thing. `said` reads as an escape hatch — words that
  failed to parse — and in their domain it is the other half of the
  answer: "договорімось", "по договорённости", "negotiable" are
  perfectly good things for a listing to say and are exactly what no
  parser will read. A caller that reads only `filled` silently drops
  them. Their words: "said is not an escape hatch, it is the other
  half of the answer, and I would say so in the doc comment."

what: say it in the doc comment, and give the door they had to write
  by hand — everything the person said, parsed or not, in one map.

files: okay-frame/src/main/scala/okay/frame/Frame.scala, its test,
  docs/modules/okay-frame.md, specs/conversation.md, BACKLOG.md
